# General Rules

- Use strict typing with Pydantic v2 and SQLAlchemy 2.0.
- Read docs/PRD.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, and docs/MEMORY.md before writing code.
- Reuse existing components; never duplicate logic.
- Keep functions small and modular.
- Do not modify unrelated files.
- Small, focused, verified commits.
